    subHeading: "Mr. Manoj Kumar Sharma, CEO of IRM Energy, discusses the company's commitment to clean energy and community-led sustainability.",
    excerpt: "IRM Energy is at the forefront of India's energy revolution, focusing on renewable generation, grid modernization, and rural electrification.",
    category: "Interviews",
