    id: 'johnson-controls',
    title: "Smart Buildings, Smarter Future: The Evolution of Urban Living",
    subHeading: "Mr. Shrikant Bapat, CEO of Johnson Controls India, on enhancing the intelligence of buildings and reducing carbon footprints.",
    excerpt: "Johnson Controls is redefining how we interact with our built environment through AI-driven automation and energy-efficient systems.",
    category: "Interviews",
    author: "The Executives Magazine",
