    id: 'kirloskar-oil',
    title: "Powering the Nation: The CFO's Perspective on Industrial Growth",
    subHeading: "Mr. Vinod Kumar, CFO & CHRO of Kirloskar Oil Engines, on the synergy between finance and people management.",
    excerpt: "Kirloskar Oil Engines is navigating the global industrial landscape through strategic investments in R&D and talent development.",
    category: "Interviews",
    author: "The Executives Magazine",
