      <p>NEI is a vocal supporter of the "Atmanirbhar Bharat" (Self-Reliant India) mission, manufacturing sophisticated bearings that were previously imported. This commitment is matched by a focus on sustainability, with NEI's manufacturing plants moving toward zero-liquid discharge and significant reliance on renewable energy. The company's Jaipur plant is a model of eco-friendly manufacturing in the region.</p>

