      <p>The roar of diesel engines is slowly being replaced by the silent hum of electric motors on Indian streets, and Olectra Greentech is a primary reason why. As the CEO, K.V. Pradeep has been instrumental in navigating the complex regulatory and technological landscape of the electric vehicle (EV) industry. "We are not just selling buses," Pradeep says. "We are selling a cleaner, quieter, and more sustainable urban future."</p>

