    pdfUrl: "/interview pages/HiMedia-Laboratories_3.pdf",
    content: `
      <h2>Embarking on a Legendary Journey through 50 Years of HiMedia Laboratories</h2>
      <p>'Want to hear an inspiring story to motivate the dormant leader and businessman in you? Well, here is the story of HiMedia Laboratories, which started off as a kitchen R&D.'</p>
      
      <h3>History and Background:</h3>
      <p>Today, HiMedia Laboratories has a rich history that spans over 5 decades. The company's journey began with a vision to contribute significantly to the field of microbiology by providing reliable and innovative products. Over the years, HiMedia has consistently worked towards achieving this goal, earning a reputation for its commitment to quality and customer satisfaction.</p>
      
      <p>HiMedia, functioning admirably without any collaborations, for the past five decades, is an excellent example of 'ATMANIRBHAR BHARAT', and promises to continue so in the future.</p>
      
      <img src="/interview-images/himedia-laboratories_3/page_1.png" alt="Dr. G. M. Warke, Founder & CMD" />

      <p>HiMedia is a family-run company, with three generations of highly educated and visionary Directors. The continuation of business to Gen Next has imparted a new dynamic vision plus a robust sense of stability to the company.</p>
      
      <p>HiMedia Laboratories is renowned for its diverse and comprehensive product portfolio. The company manufactures and supplies a vast array of culture media, antibiotics susceptibility tools, biochemicals, and diagnostic products and vast array of services. These products cater to a broad spectrum of applications, including microbiology, cell culture, molecular biology, and diagnostics. The company's commitment to quality assurance ensures that its products meet the stringent standards required by researchers and laboratories globally.</p>

      <h3>Landmark achievements and Research:</h3>
      <p>Manufacturing challenging products for a Japanese company on time and fighting the coronavirus pandemic by providing COVID detection and Virus Transport Medium Kits, etc. are some of the many landmark achievements. One of the key factors contributing to HiMedia Laboratories' success is its commitment to innovation and research. The company invests significantly in research and development to stay at the forefront of scientific advancements in Biosciences.</p>
      
      <img src="/interview-images/himedia-laboratories_3/page_3.png" alt="HiMedia Research Facility" />

      <p>This commitment enables HiMedia to introduce new and improved products that cater to the evolving needs of the scientific community. HiMedia ensures development and introduction of at least 20 new products per annum for our esteemed patrons. By collaborating with researchers and staying informed about the latest developments in the life sciences, HiMedia Laboratories continues to expand its product offerings. This proactive approach not only benefits the company but also plays a crucial role in advancing scientific research globally.</p>
    `,
